<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59102" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορθύνω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορθύω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρθυς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lift up, raise</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς κόρθυνεν ἑὸν μένος</span>
			<i>raised high</i> his wrath, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				853
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖτέ με θυμὸς κορθύσῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hymn.Is.</u>
					150
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦμα κορθύεται</span>
			<i>waxes high, rears its crest</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπερθε δὲ . . ἁλὸς κορθύεται ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.322
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
